{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23145","headline":"见于给事暇日上直寄南省诸郎官诗因以戏赠 · 白居易","name":"见于给事暇日上直寄南省诸郎官诗因以戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倚作天仙弄地仙，夸张一日抵千年。\n黄麻勅胜长生籙，白紵词嫌内景篇。\n云彩误居青琐地，风流合在紫微天。\n东曹渐去西垣近，鹤驾无妨更着鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}